    {
      "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-11",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "11 December 2024",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-service-act-1999#sec-11"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-service-act-1999.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.1",
      "values:originalText": "Includes amendments:\nAct No. 44, 2024\n\nAbout this compilation\nThis compilation\nThis is a compilation of the Public Service Act 1999 that shows the text of the\nlaw as amended and in force on 11 December 2024 (the compilation date).\nThe notes at the end of this compilation (the endnotes) include information\nabout amending laws and the amendment history of provisions of the compiled\nlaw.\nUncommenced amendments\nThe effect of uncommenced amendments is not shown in the text of the\ncompiled law. Any uncommenced amendments affecting the law are accessible\non the Register (www.legislation.gov.au). The details of amendments made up\nto, but not commenced at, the compilation date are underlined in the endnotes.\nFor more information on any uncommenced amendments, see the Register for\nthe compiled law.\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions for provisions and\namendments\nIf the operation of a provision or amendment of the compiled law is affected by\nan application, saving or transitional provision that is not included in this\ncompilation, details are included in the endnotes.\nEditorial changes\nFor more information about any editorial changes made in this compilation, see\nthe endnotes.\nModifications\nIf the compiled law is modified by another law, the compiled law operates as\nmodified but the modification does not amend the text of the law. Accordingly,\nthis compilation does not show the text of the compiled law as modified. For\nmore information on any modifications, see the Register for the compiled law.\nSelf-repealing provisions\nIf a provision of the compiled law has been repealed in accordance with a\nprovision of the law, details are included in the endnotes.\n\n\nPublic Service Act 1999\ni\nCompilation date: 11/12/2024\nContents",
      "skos:definition": "Includes amendments:\nAct No. 44, 2024\n\nAbout this compilation\nThis compilation\nThis is a compilation of the Public Service Act 1999 that shows the text of the\nlaw as amended and in force on 11 December 2024 (the compilation date).\nThe notes at the end of this compilation (the endnotes) include information\nabout amending laws and the amendment history of provisions of the compiled\nlaw.\nUncommenced amendments\nThe effect of uncommenced amendments is not shown in the text of the\ncompiled law. Any uncommenced amendments affecting the law are accessible\non the Register (www.legislation.gov.au). The details of amendments made up\nto, but not commenced at, the compilation date are underlined in the endnotes.\nFor more information on any uncommenced amendments, see the Register for\nthe compiled law.\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions for provisions and\namendments\nIf the operation of a provision or amendment of the compiled law is affected by\nan application, saving or transitional provision that is not included in this\ncompilation, details are included in the endnotes.\nEditorial changes\nFor more information about any editorial changes made in this compilation, see\nthe endnotes.\nModifications\nIf the compiled law is modified by another law, the compiled law operates as\nmodified but the modification does not amend the text of the law. Accordingly,\nthis compilation does not show the text of the compiled law as modified. For\nmore information on any modifications, see the Register for the compiled law.\nSelf-repealing provisions\nIf a provision of the compiled law has been repealed in accordance with a\nprovision of the law, details are included in the endnotes.\n\n\nPublic Service Act 1999\ni\nCompilation date: 11/12/2024\nContents",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-11-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-11-logic-descriptionlogic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "964ab2743c963f60fa937a22139559cc26c173f7697e14119d7481a7cffb9284",
      "skos:note": "Compilation information and notes on amendments."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-service-act-1999#sec-11",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "11 December 2024",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 1,
      "values:originalText": "Includes amendments:\nAct No. 44, 2024\n\nAbout this compilation\nThis compilation\nThis is a compilation of the Public Service Act 1999 that shows the text of the\nlaw as amended and in force on 11 December 2024 (the compilation date).\nThe notes at the end of this compilation (the endnotes) include information\nabout amending laws and the amendment history of provisions of the compiled\nlaw.\nUncommenced amendments\nThe effect of uncommenced amendments is not shown in the text of the\ncompiled law. Any uncommenced amendments affecting the law are accessible\non the Register (www.legislation.gov.au). The details of amendments made up\nto, but not commenced at, the compilation date are underlined in the endnotes.\nFor more information on any uncommenced amendments, see the Register for\nthe compiled law.\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions for provisions and\namendments\nIf the operation of a provision or amendment of the compiled law is affected by\nan application, saving or transitional provision that is not included in this\ncompilation, details are included in the endnotes.\nEditorial changes\nFor more information about any editorial changes made in this compilation, see\nthe endnotes.\nModifications\nIf the compiled law is modified by another law, the compiled law operates as\nmodified but the modification does not amend the text of the law. Accordingly,\nthis compilation does not show the text of the compiled law as modified. For\nmore information on any modifications, see the Register for the compiled law.\nSelf-repealing provisions\nIf a provision of the compiled law has been repealed in accordance with a\nprovision of the law, details are included in the endnotes.\n\n\nPublic Service Act 1999\ni\nCompilation date: 11/12/2024\nContents"
    },
    {
