      },
      "dc:source": "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "This Act may be cited as the Public Service Act 1999.\nNote:\nSee also the Public Employment (Consequential and Transitional)\nAmendment Act 1999.",
      "skos:definition": "This Act may be cited as the Public Service Act 1999.\nNote:\nSee also the Public Employment (Consequential and Transitional)\nAmendment Act 1999.",
