      },
      "dc:source": "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If this Act does not commence under subsection (1) within the\nperiod of 6 months beginning on the day on which it receives the\nRoyal Assent, it commences on the first day after the end of that\nperiod.",
