      "dc:source": "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The APS is professional, objective, innovative and efficient, and\nworks collaboratively to achieve the best results for the Australian\ncommunity and the Government.\nEthical",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The APS is professional, objective, innovative and efficient, and\nworks collaboratively to achieve the best results for the Australian\ncommunity and the Government.\nEthical",
      "values:partOf": {
