      },
      "dc:source": "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The APS is apolitical and provides the Government with advice\nthat is frank, honest, timely and based on the best available\nevidence.\n\n\nThe Australian Public Service  Part 3\n\nSection 10A\nPublic Service Act 1999\nCompilation date: 11/12/2024\nStewardship",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The APS is apolitical and provides the Government with advice\nthat is frank, honest, timely and based on the best available\nevidence.\n\n\nThe Australian Public Service  Part 3\n\nSection 10A\nPublic Service Act 1999\nCompilation date: 11/12/2024\nStewardship",
      "values:partOf": {
