    {
      "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-11-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "11 Commissioner’s Directions about APS Values",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-service-act-1999#sec-11-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-service-act-1999.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commissioner may issue directions in writing in relation to\nany of the APS Values for the purpose of:\n(a) ensuring that the APS incorporates and upholds the APS\nValues; and\n(b) determining where necessary the scope or application of the\nAPS Values.\nNote:\nSee section 42 for general provisions relating to Commissioner’s\nDirections.\n(2) For the purposes of this Act other than this section, the APS Values\nhave effect subject to the restrictions (if any) in directions made\nunder subsection (1).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Commissioner may issue directions in writing in relation to\nany of the APS Values for the purpose of:\n(a) ensuring that the APS incorporates and upholds the APS\nValues; and\n(b) determining where necessary the scope or application of the\nAPS Values.\nNote:\nSee section 42 for general provisions relating to Commissioner’s\nDirections.\n(2) For the purposes of this Act other than this section, the APS Values\nhave effect subject to the restrictions (if any) in directions made\nunder subsection (1).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-11-2-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-11-2-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "899141267789eb8cdfd6009604fb6fa4b6e17cba4e45fba762a1a53c1d3bc6f5"
    },
