      },
      "dc:source": "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "(6) In this section:\nindustrial instrument means:\n(a) a modern award; or\n(b) an enterprise agreement; or\n(c) a workplace determination; or\n(d) a WR Act transitional instrument; or\n(e) a transitional APCS.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) In this section:\nindustrial instrument means:\n(a) a modern award; or\n(b) an enterprise agreement; or\n(c) a workplace determination; or\n(d) a WR Act transitional instrument; or\n(e) a transitional APCS.",
      "values:partOf": {
