      "dc:source": "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "(5) A determination under subsection (3) overrides the following, to\nthe extent of any inconsistency:\n(a) a determination under subsection (1);\n(b) the Australian Fair Pay and Conditions Standard;\n(c) the National Employment Standards.",
