      "dc:source": "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.29",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If an APS employee receives any non-Commonwealth\nremuneration for performing duties as an APS employee, then the\nAgency Head may give a notice in writing to the employee in\nrelation to the whole, or a specified part, of the remuneration.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If an APS employee receives any non-Commonwealth\nremuneration for performing duties as an APS employee, then the\nAgency Head may give a notice in writing to the employee in\nrelation to the whole, or a specified part, of the remuneration.",
      "values:partOf": {
