      "cml:integrityHash": "ef5846b25fbafb7553d295e74bd7276053e7c480b86e1301394ba221d12f372c",
      "skos:note": "Agency Head must comply with direction from Agency Minister."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-service-act-1999#sec-39-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "39(2) Heads of Mission",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 35,
      "values:originalText": "(2) An Agency Head must comply with any direction in writing by the\nAgency Minister:\n(a) directing the Agency Head to engage a particular person as\nan APS employee so that the person can become a Head of\nMission; or\n(b) directing the Agency Head to assign particular duties to an\nAPS employee who has been appointed as a Head of\nMission."
    },
    {
