    {
      "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-41a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41A(2) Inquiry into alleged breach of Code of Conduct by Agency",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-service-act-1999#sec-41a-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-service-act-1999.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.38",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Commissioner must report on the results of an inquiry and\ndetermination under this section (including, if relevant,\nrecommendations for sanctions) to:\n(a) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, a\nSecretary—the Prime Minister; or\n(b) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, the\nHead of an Executive Agency—the Agency Minister; or\n(c) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, the\nHead of a Statutory Agency that is prescribed by the\nregulations for the purposes of this paragraph—the Presiding\nOfficers; or\n(d) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, the\nHead of a Statutory Agency that is not prescribed by the\nregulations for the purposes of paragraph (c)—the Agency\nMinister.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Commissioner must report on the results of an inquiry and\ndetermination under this section (including, if relevant,\nrecommendations for sanctions) to:\n(a) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, a\nSecretary—the Prime Minister; or\n(b) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, the\nHead of an Executive Agency—the Agency Minister; or\n(c) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, the\nHead of a Statutory Agency that is prescribed by the\nregulations for the purposes of this paragraph—the Presiding\nOfficers; or\n(d) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, the\nHead of a Statutory Agency that is not prescribed by the\nregulations for the purposes of paragraph (c)—the Agency\nMinister.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-41a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-41a-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-41a-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4f8c5b4228019368a66d32349a07c0d1ec492f47ce64215f0f788f00355fb0a2",
      "skos:note": "Report results of inquiry and determination to specified authorities.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-service-act-1999#sec-41a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41A(2) Inquiry into alleged breach of Code of Conduct by Agency",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 38,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Commissioner must report on the results of an inquiry and\ndetermination under this section (including, if relevant,\nrecommendations for sanctions) to:\n(a) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, a\nSecretary—the Prime Minister; or\n(b) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, the\nHead of an Executive Agency—the Agency Minister; or\n(c) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, the\nHead of a Statutory Agency that is prescribed by the\nregulations for the purposes of this paragraph—the Presiding\nOfficers; or\n(d) if the Agency Head is, or the former Agency Head was, the\nHead of a Statutory Agency that is not prescribed by the\nregulations for the purposes of paragraph (c)—the Agency\nMinister."
    },
