      "dc:source": "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.38",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The regulations may prescribe circumstances in which the\nCommissioner:\n(a) may decline to conduct an inquiry under subsection (1); or",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The regulations may prescribe circumstances in which the\nCommissioner:\n(a) may decline to conduct an inquiry under subsection (1); or",
