      },
      "dc:source": "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.40",
      "values:originalText": "(6) Procedures established under subsection (3) are not legislative\ninstruments.\nCommissioner’s powers",
      "skos:definition": "(6) Procedures established under subsection (3) are not legislative\ninstruments.\nCommissioner’s powers",
