      "skos:note": "Commissioner must recommend sanctions if breach of Code of Conduct is found."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-service-act-1999#sec-41b-ss-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41B(9) Inquiry into alleged breach of Code of Conduct by APS",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 40,
      "values:originalText": "(9) If:\n(a) the Commissioner finds that an APS employee in an Agency\nhas breached the Code of Conduct; and\n(b) the Commissioner is requested to recommend sanctions in\nrespect of the breach by:\n(i) the Agency Head; or"
    },
