      "dc:source": "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.45",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If a person causes a capability review of an Agency to be\nundertaken under subsection (1) or (3), the person must:\n(a) notify the Agency Head of the Agency, in writing, of the\nreview; and\n(b) appoint one or more persons, in writing, to undertake the\nreview; and\n(ba) ensure that the person or persons who undertake the review\nconsult the Agency Minister of the Agency in undertaking\nthe review; and",
