      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 60,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Subsection (3) does not apply in relation to a person who is\nreappointed as the Secretary of a Department. In this case, the\nperson’s appointment may be for any period not exceeding 5 years."
    },
