      "values:originalText": "(8) The report from the Secretary of the Prime Minister’s Department\nabout the appointment of the Secretary of another Department\nmust:\n(a) be prepared after consultation with:\n(i) the Commissioner; and\n(ii) the person who is expected to be the Agency Minister of\nthe other Department at the time the appointment is\nmade; and",
      "skos:definition": "(8) The report from the Secretary of the Prime Minister’s Department\nabout the appointment of the Secretary of another Department\nmust:\n(a) be prepared after consultation with:\n(i) the Commissioner; and\n(ii) the person who is expected to be the Agency Minister of\nthe other Department at the time the appointment is\nmade; and",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-58"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-58-ss-8-norm"
        },
