      "skos:definition": "(1) The Secretaries Board may cause long-term insights reports to be\nprepared in relation to one or more matters of public policy.\n\n\nSecretaries Board  Part 8\n\nSection 64A\nPublic Service Act 1999\nCompilation date: 11/12/2024",
      "values:partOf": {
