      "cml:integrityHash": "c57e18d460dec07a703f920b63971416f22004c7d39a9df6dfa303fc3eab1602",
      "skos:note": "The Secretaries Board may cause long-term insights reports to be prepared."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-service-act-1999#sec-64a-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "64A(1) Long-term insights reports",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 64,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Secretaries Board may cause long-term insights reports to be\nprepared in relation to one or more matters of public policy.\n\n\nSecretaries Board  Part 8\n\nSection 64A\nPublic Service Act 1999\nCompilation date: 11/12/2024"
    },
    {
