      "cml:integrityHash": "975307f67972bce6a4dc71720f62490083151fa50ea48125a7392faadd7f61f5",
      "skos:note": "Must provide information about trends, risks, and opportunities.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-service-act-1999#sec-64a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "64A(2) Long-term insights reports",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 64,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The purpose of a long-term insights report is to make available:\n(a) information about medium-term and long-term trends, risks,\nand opportunities that affect or may affect Australia or\nAustralian society; and\n(b) information and impartial analysis relating to those trends,\nrisks and opportunities."
    },
