      "dc:source": "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.64",
      "values:originalText": "(3A) As soon as practicable after a long-term insights report has been\ncompleted, the Secretaries Board must give the report to the Public\nService Minister.",
      "skos:definition": "(3A) As soon as practicable after a long-term insights report has been\ncompleted, the Secretaries Board must give the report to the Public\nService Minister.",
