    {
      "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-64a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "64A(4) Long-term insights reports",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-service-act-1999#sec-64a-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-service-act-1999.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.64",
      "values:originalText": "(4) As soon as practicable after a long-term insights report has been\ngiven to the Public Service Minister, the report must be published,\nin the manner and form the Secretaries Board considers\nappropriate:\n(a) on an Agency website; and\n(b) if the Secretaries Board considers appropriate—elsewhere.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) As soon as practicable after a long-term insights report has been\ngiven to the Public Service Minister, the report must be published,\nin the manner and form the Secretaries Board considers\nappropriate:\n(a) on an Agency website; and\n(b) if the Secretaries Board considers appropriate—elsewhere.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-64a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-64a-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-64a-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2b1f5c403ba8f6bc147c5aac28ed6bebddc446127e03c66f0b352fe0ff1c7505",
      "skos:note": "Publish long-term insights report on Agency website and elsewhere if appropriate.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-service-act-1999#sec-64a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "64A(4) Long-term insights reports",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 64,
      "values:originalText": "(4) As soon as practicable after a long-term insights report has been\ngiven to the Public Service Minister, the report must be published,\nin the manner and form the Secretaries Board considers\nappropriate:\n(a) on an Agency website; and\n(b) if the Secretaries Board considers appropriate—elsewhere."
    },
