      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-service-act-1999.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.74",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Subject to subsection (6), the Merit Protection Commissioner may\ndisclose protected information to a person, or to the public or a\nsection of the public, if the Merit Protection Commissioner is\nsatisfied that:\n(a) the disclosure:\n(i) is in the interests of an Agency or a person; or\n(ii) is in the public interest; and",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Subject to subsection (6), the Merit Protection Commissioner may\ndisclose protected information to a person, or to the public or a\nsection of the public, if the Merit Protection Commissioner is\nsatisfied that:\n(a) the disclosure:\n(i) is in the interests of an Agency or a person; or\n(ii) is in the public interest; and",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-72b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-72b-ss-5-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0a3c3dd3113d441cdb634da342841e6af11441ff9941acf37cdb29871e3dd0f7",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of protected information under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-service-act-1999#sec-72b-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "72B(5) Protection of information—Merit Protection Commissioner’s",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 74,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Subject to subsection (6), the Merit Protection Commissioner may\ndisclose protected information to a person, or to the public or a\nsection of the public, if the Merit Protection Commissioner is\nsatisfied that:\n(a) the disclosure:\n(i) is in the interests of an Agency or a person; or\n(ii) is in the public interest; and"
    },
