    {
      "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-72c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "72C Giving information or producing documents to Commissioner",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-service-act-1999#sec-72c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-service-act-1999.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.77",
      "values:originalText": "not admissible in evidence etc.\nApplication\n(1) This section applies if:\n(a) either:\n(i) the Commissioner requests a person to give information\n(including an answer to a question) or produce a\ndocument to the Commissioner for purposes connected\nwith the performance of functions or duties, or the\nexercise of powers, under a provision referred to in\nsubsection (2); or\n(ii) a person reasonably believes that information or a\ndocument is relevant for purposes connected with the\nperformance of functions or duties, or the exercise of\npowers, under a provision referred to in subsection (2);\nand\n(b) the person obtained the information or document lawfully;\nand\n(c) the person gives the information or produces the document to\nthe Commissioner.\n(2) For the purposes of subparagraphs (1)(a)(i) and (ii), the provisions\nare:\n(a) paragraphs 41(2)(j), (k), (m), (n) and (o); and\n(b) sections 41A, 41B, 41C, 41D and 43; and\n(c) any other provision of this Act or the regulations prescribed\nby the regulations for the purposes of this paragraph.\nGiving information or producing document not admissible in\nevidence in certain proceedings\n(3) If, by giving the information or producing the document to the\nCommissioner, the person:",
      "skos:definition": "not admissible in evidence etc.\nApplication\n(1) This section applies if:\n(a) either:\n(i) the Commissioner requests a person to give information\n(including an answer to a question) or produce a\ndocument to the Commissioner for purposes connected\nwith the performance of functions or duties, or the\nexercise of powers, under a provision referred to in\nsubsection (2); or\n(ii) a person reasonably believes that information or a\ndocument is relevant for purposes connected with the\nperformance of functions or duties, or the exercise of\npowers, under a provision referred to in subsection (2);\nand\n(b) the person obtained the information or document lawfully;\nand\n(c) the person gives the information or produces the document to\nthe Commissioner.\n(2) For the purposes of subparagraphs (1)(a)(i) and (ii), the provisions\nare:\n(a) paragraphs 41(2)(j), (k), (m), (n) and (o); and\n(b) sections 41A, 41B, 41C, 41D and 43; and\n(c) any other provision of this Act or the regulations prescribed\nby the regulations for the purposes of this paragraph.\nGiving information or producing document not admissible in\nevidence in certain proceedings\n(3) If, by giving the information or producing the document to the\nCommissioner, the person:",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-72c-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-72c-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-72c-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1a0928621504c047daef5f4fca7dee1a387c4c34a62a29bd157e160bbd5fdf47"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-service-act-1999#sec-72c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "72C Giving information or producing documents to Commissioner",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 77,
      "values:originalText": "not admissible in evidence etc.\nApplication\n(1) This section applies if:\n(a) either:\n(i) the Commissioner requests a person to give information\n(including an answer to a question) or produce a\ndocument to the Commissioner for purposes connected\nwith the performance of functions or duties, or the\nexercise of powers, under a provision referred to in\nsubsection (2); or\n(ii) a person reasonably believes that information or a\ndocument is relevant for purposes connected with the\nperformance of functions or duties, or the exercise of\npowers, under a provision referred to in subsection (2);\nand\n(b) the person obtained the information or document lawfully;\nand\n(c) the person gives the information or produces the document to\nthe Commissioner.\n(2) For the purposes of subparagraphs (1)(a)(i) and (ii), the provisions\nare:\n(a) paragraphs 41(2)(j), (k), (m), (n) and (o); and\n(b) sections 41A, 41B, 41C, 41D and 43; and\n(c) any other provision of this Act or the regulations prescribed\nby the regulations for the purposes of this paragraph.\nGiving information or producing document not admissible in\nevidence in certain proceedings\n(3) If, by giving the information or producing the document to the\nCommissioner, the person:"
    },
