      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) An Agency Head is not subject to direction by any Minister in relation to the exercise of powers by the Agency Head under this section...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "An Agency Head's autonomy from Ministerial direction diffuses to other individuals exercising powers under this section."
    },
