      "dc:source": "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.84",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The Merit Protection Commissioner may, in writing, delegate to an\nAPS employee any of the Merit Protection Commissioner’s powers\nor functions under this Act (other than this section).",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The Merit Protection Commissioner may, in writing, delegate to an\nAPS employee any of the Merit Protection Commissioner’s powers\nor functions under this Act (other than this section).",
