    {
      "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-78-ss-12",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "78(12) Delegations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-service-act-1999#sec-78-ss-12"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "public-service-act-1999.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "public-service-act-1999.pdf, p.84",
      "values:originalText": "(12) In this section:\nformer senior official means:\n(a) a person who held, but no longer holds, an office or\nappointment under an Act; or\n(b) a person who was, but is no longer, an SES employee, and\nwho does not hold an office or appointment under an Act.\nsenior official means:\n(a) a person who holds any office or appointment under an Act;\nor\n(b) an SES employee or acting SES employee.",
      "skos:definition": "(12) In this section:\nformer senior official means:\n(a) a person who held, but no longer holds, an office or\nappointment under an Act; or\n(b) a person who was, but is no longer, an SES employee, and\nwho does not hold an office or appointment under an Act.\nsenior official means:\n(a) a person who holds any office or appointment under an Act;\nor\n(b) an SES employee or acting SES employee.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-78"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:public-service-act-1999-sec-78-ss-12-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "264ecfd63ef18ba2423d6b698a79ca30a0f65876b11f3b76dcef977f9a83eeb0",
      "skos:note": "Defines terms for senior and former senior officials."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/public-service-act-1999#sec-78-ss-12",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "78(12) Delegations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 84,
      "values:originalText": "(12) In this section:\nformer senior official means:\n(a) a person who held, but no longer holds, an office or\nappointment under an Act; or\n(b) a person who was, but is no longer, an SES employee, and\nwho does not hold an office or appointment under an Act.\nsenior official means:\n(a) a person who holds any office or appointment under an Act;\nor\n(b) an SES employee or acting SES employee."
    },
